OL,3,ATrump ordered to answer questions under
OL,4,Aoath in BBC lawsuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA US judge has ordered Donald Trump to
OL,7,Fanswer questions under oath in his
OL,8,Fdefamation lawsuit against the BBC by
OL,9,F11 December.
OL,11,FThe US president is suing the BBC over
OL,12,Fan episode of Panorama that edited
OL,13,Ftogether two different sections of a
OL,14,Fspeech he gave before the riot at the
OL,15,FUS Capitol in 2021.
OL,17,FTrump cancelled a previous deposition -
OL,18,Fan interview under oath - on 16
OL,19,FOctober, citing "matters of national
OL,20,Fimportance".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,171,160,200,105,0,100
